model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Ordinary apps keep known sign-in choices and credential drafts through background metadata reads and retained failures. Provider-app connection controls require a settled host policy and retain recovery after a failed refresh. Reads with no value retain loading, failure and retry behavior. Account-row traffic and sharing reads retain their existing boundaries. Reusing the same saved authorization for an already-connected target preserves its existing account binding."
    }
  }
}
